### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@mulligans.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "displayName": "Test User"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
